### DEMO 2/2 — odigraj turnir UZIVO
### NE "Run all"! Klikni zeleni > pored svakog koraka, jedan po jedan,
### i gledaj spectator stranicu u browseru kako se sama mijenja.
### "Riot podaci" koraci salju snapshot kroz RabbitMQ (vrijeme, kills, gold, tornjevi ispod kartice).
### (varijable dolaze iz demo-setup.http — prvo pokreni njega; RabbitMQ mora raditi)

@host = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Polufinale 1 pocinje (kartica postaje LIVE)
POST {{host}}/api/matches/{{dPf1}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{dTR}}

### 2. PF1 Riot podaci
POST {{host}}/api/matches/{{dPf1}}/simulate-snapshot
Authorization: Bearer {{dTR}}

### 3. PF1 Riot podaci
POST {{host}}/api/matches/{{dPf1}}/simulate-snapshot
Authorization: Bearer {{dTR}}

### 4. PF1 rezultat 1:0
PUT {{host}}/api/matches/{{dPf1}}/score
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{dTR}}

{ "scoreA": 1, "scoreB": 0 }

### 5. PF1 Riot podaci
POST {{host}}/api/matches/{{dPf1}}/simulate-snapshot
Authorization: Bearer {{dTR}}

### 6. PF1 kraj 2:1 (pobjednik ulazi u finale)
POST {{host}}/api/matches/{{dPf1}}/finish
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{dTR}}

{ "scoreA": 2, "scoreB": 1 }

### 7. Polufinale 2 pocinje
POST {{host}}/api/matches/{{dPf2}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{dTR}}

### 8. PF2 Riot podaci
POST {{host}}/api/matches/{{dPf2}}/simulate-snapshot
Authorization: Bearer {{dTR}}

### 9. PF2 rezultat 0:1
PUT {{host}}/api/matches/{{dPf2}}/score
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{dTR}}

{ "scoreA": 0, "scoreB": 1 }

### 10. PF2 Riot podaci
POST {{host}}/api/matches/{{dPf2}}/simulate-snapshot
Authorization: Bearer {{dTR}}

### 11. PF2 kraj 0:2 (drugi finalista)
POST {{host}}/api/matches/{{dPf2}}/finish
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{dTR}}

{ "scoreA": 0, "scoreB": 2 }

### 12. FINALE pocinje
POST {{host}}/api/matches/{{dFin}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{dTR}}

### 13. Finale Riot podaci
POST {{host}}/api/matches/{{dFin}}/simulate-snapshot
Authorization: Bearer {{dTR}}

### 14. Finale 1:0
PUT {{host}}/api/matches/{{dFin}}/score
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{dTR}}

{ "scoreA": 1, "scoreB": 0 }

### 15. Finale Riot podaci
POST {{host}}/api/matches/{{dFin}}/simulate-snapshot
Authorization: Bearer {{dTR}}

### 16. Finale 2:1
PUT {{host}}/api/matches/{{dFin}}/score
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{dTR}}

{ "scoreA": 2, "scoreB": 1 }

### 17. Finale Riot podaci
POST {{host}}/api/matches/{{dFin}}/simulate-snapshot
Authorization: Bearer {{dTR}}

### 18. FINALE kraj 3:1 — imamo prvaka, turnir COMPLETED
POST {{host}}/api/matches/{{dFin}}/finish
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{dTR}}

{ "scoreA": 3, "scoreB": 1 }
